        <briefdescription>
<para>Rebuilds the theme state tree from the given theme directory. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads theme.lua and whelmed.lua from <computeroutput>~/</computeroutput>.config/end/themes/<computeroutput>theme/</computeroutput> and rebuilds the live state tree. Called by <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref> after loadFromPath() and on theme value change.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>theme</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="structconfig_1_1_theme" kindref="compound">Theme</ref> directory name (e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;gfx&quot;</computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
