    <briefdescription>
<para>Theme-specific visual properties model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns the live <ref refid="classjuce_1_1ValueTree" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::ValueTree</ref> of colours, fonts, and metrics sourced from the active theme&apos;s lua files (e.g. <computeroutput>themes/gfx/theme.lua</computeroutput>). The tree <ref refid="struct_i_d" kindref="compound">ID</ref> is the theme name passed at construction (e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;gfx&quot;</computeroutput>).</para>
<para>Owned by <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref>. One instance per process.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classjam_1_1Model" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Model</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
